[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3052680314","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108423#issuecomment-3052680314","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108423","id":3052680314,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc619DR6","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-09T13:28:14Z","updated_at":"2025-07-09T13:28:14Z","body":"This is expected behavior, not a bug. `get_content_*` are not supposed to be affected by visible characters.\n\nBehavior with the `VC_CHARS_BEFORE_SHAPING` was inconsistent before https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107373, now it works as intended in all modes.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3052680314/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3052701816","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108423#issuecomment-3052701816","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108423","id":3052701816,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc619Ih4","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-09T13:35:01Z","updated_at":"2025-07-09T13:35:01Z","body":"You can get the height of the visible text using, but not the width:\n\n```gdscript\nvar last_visible_line = $RichTextLabel.get_visible_line_count() - 1\nsize.y = $RichTextLabel.get_line_offset(last_visible_line) + $RichTextLabel.get_line_height(last_visible_line)\n```\n\nSeems like broken `VC_CHARS_BEFORE_SHAPING` behavior was used in multiple cases (like scrolling https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104722 and this), so this is probably another thing that should be added as separate methods.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3052701816/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues